%SIXMD 1
# @?LOGDUMP - PRINT RETAINED LOGSTORE RECORDS

## DESCRIPTION

LOGDUMP READS THE CURRENT LOGSTORE RING NONDESTRUCTIVELY AND PRINTS VALID
RETAINED RECORDS FROM OLDEST TO NEWEST.  IT DOES NOT ADVANCE LOGDRAIN STATE.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - RETAINED RECORDS WERE READ
### @?1 - LOGSTORE OR OUTPUT FAILED

## @?SEE ALSO

### @?LOGD
### @?LOGDRAIN
